Hello Arthur,

How are you doing during these uneasy times?
It's been very long since we connected here on LinkedIn, and many things have changed. I went through your profile again and thought maybe we, Azati, can bring value to Gale Healthcare at this time. 

My team’s strongest industry knowledge lies in HealthTech & Machine Learning, and Azati helps Technical Product Managers to optimize existing processes with software. Here are the examples of what we did:
1. Enriched client’s Hospital Software and merged two databases (patient records & doctor records);
3. Rebuilt client’s E-health Web Portal with modern technologies and elegant designs;
3. Developed an AI-based model that analyzes data from medical questionnaires, finds insights, and builds reports;
4. Implemented a semantic search engine powered by ML that handles substantial scientific datasets (in vitro diagnostics);
And many more.

Arthur, I’m wondering if you would find our expertise useful? If so, we’d be glad to meet and chat about your needs.

Have a fantastic day,
Lisa

Great meeting you too at SX - the late shifts were the best - hope we can collab one day ; )

Cheers,
@b_radley

Dear Arthur,

Here is a brief message to ask if you might be interested in any of the following software outsourcing development services our company provides: 

- Mobile applications development (iPhone/iPad, Android, Windows Phone, etc); 
- Web-based solutions (HTML5, PHP, Python, MySQL, JQuery, AJAX, JS, Flash, ActionScript, Flex, etc); 
- System development (Java, .NET, C++, C# etc); 
- CMS development (Sharepoint, Alfresco, Documentum);
- Game development and 3D (Unity 3D, DirectX, OpenGL on native code, C++ for Windows, Objective-C for iPhone, etc); 
- Cloud technologies (Windows Azure).

Thank you for consideration. Please, contact me at Nadya.Klim@altabel.com to receive more information about our expertise (CVs, references and any other additional information) and to receive our proposals for your upcoming projects. 

Looking forward to hearing back from you soon! 

Best Regards,
Nadya Klim 
